 class="t m0 x53 h6 ydc8 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑣<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff4">的更新利用了<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>𝐴𝑥<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">−<span class="_ _19"> </span></span>𝑏<span class="ff4">（即约束的<span class="_ _28"></span>“残差”<span class="_ _29"></span>）<span class="_ _5"></span>来调整对偶变量<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑣<span class="_ _1"></span></span>。<span class="_ _28"></span>如果<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐴𝑥</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h14 ydc9 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑘</div><div class="t m0 x7d h6 ydc8 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑏<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">≠<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">0<span class="ff4">，<span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff8">𝑣<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff4">将会改变，<span class="_ _4"></span>从而在下</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 ydca ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">一步的<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff3">-</span></span>更新中施加更强（或更弱）的“惩罚”<span class="_ _29"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 xf h10 ydcb ff9 fs4 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">5.3<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1">一般约束问题的优化算法</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 ydcc ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">现在我们转向包含不等式约束<span class="_ _13"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑓</span></div><div class="t m0 x3e h14 ydcd ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x3f h6 ydcc ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span></span>)<span class="_ _8"> </span>≤<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffb">0<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff4">的一般优化问题。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xf h16 ydce ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.3.1<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">内点法<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>(Interior<span class="_ _2"> </span>